{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>中午12時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其在大帽山行山期間胸口痛。警方，消防接報到場搜救，政府飛行服務隊亦奉召協助，其後發現48歲姓楊男事主昏迷，他由直升機救起送往東區醫院，惟經搶救證實不治。警方列作送院時死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.033642+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:57:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:51.699747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.546327+00:00","content_hash":"05578bce598570c06a989c478436597a31773132692a9ba45f9feac0d168eab1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}